1,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1968401506,"text":"I don't mind little critters bumping into me, so long as the kuuvahki emanating from them reflects no ill-intent.","nextNodeIds":[760310112]},{"nodeId":760310112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3715016282,"text":"Did something happen? Why are you so afraid, little one?","nextNodeIds":[760310113]},{"nodeId":760310113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15605,"speakerName":"Chic Badger","textMapHash":1825381114,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[760310114]},{"nodeId":760310114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":4115055618,"text":"Hm, I see.","nextNodeIds":[760310115]},{"nodeId":760310115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1276890290,"text":"Ooh, so you can understand these animals too?","nextNodeIds":[760310116]},{"nodeId":760310116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":256378194,"text":"The moon shines high over Nod-Krai. All animals that grow beneath the light of kuuvahki can be considered \"familiars of the Moon Goddess.\"","nextNodeIds":[760310117]},{"nodeId":760310117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":355352386,"text":"So, what did this little guy say?","nextNodeIds":[760310118]},{"nodeId":760310118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":2257708130,"text":"That monsters have appeared where he lives. He was looking for Lauma, but the monsters chased him to this area...","nextNodeIds":[760310119]},{"nodeId":760310119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1876492394,"text":"Ohh... No wonder he's so scared...","nextNodeIds":[760310120]},{"nodeId":760310120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":680381642,"text":"Where should we take him?","nextNodeIds":[760310121]},{"nodeId":760310121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3906107474,"text":"Back to Lauma, I think. She will know how to handle this.","nextNodeIds":[760310122]},{"nodeId":760310122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3353799954,"text":"Alright, looks like it's another trip out for us. Since we're heading to the Frostmoon Scions, make sure you hide extra good this time!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7603101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_TEAM_DEAD","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133603042","0"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1318"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7603102,"order":3,"stepDescription":"Meet Lauma","stepDescTextMapHash":2082740804,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7603102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1315"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_