xtMapHash":1223420402,"text":"Seriously!?","nextNodeIds":[760310307]},{"nodeId":760310307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"Lauma","textMapHash":1122983138,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[760310308]},{"nodeId":760310308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"Lauma","textMapHash":3724344842,"text":"...Thank you for your hard work. Excuse me for a moment. I will be back shortly.","nextNodeIds":[760310309]},{"nodeId":760310309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"Lauma","textMapHash":752619762,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[760310310]},{"nodeId":760310310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"Lauma","textMapHash":2473285850,"text":"There is no one around. You can come out now.","nextNodeIds":[760310311]},{"nodeId":760310311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2385783138,"text":"Wait, you knew we were here!?","nextNodeIds":[760310312]},{"nodeId":760310312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"Lauma","textMapHash":749361074,"text":"How could I possibly miss the \"Kuu{RUBY#[S]Moon Maiden}tar\" and her kuuvahki?","nextNodeIds":[760310313]},{"nodeId":760310313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"Lauma","textMapHash":735875618,"text":"Although... I'm not quite sure why you're following me. It's quite unnerving... being \"observed\" at work like this...","nextNodeIds":[760310314]},{"nodeId":760310314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4096778098,"text":"Oh, um... S—Sorry about that. We wanted to ask you about something, but the time was never right... Hopefully, we didn't stress you out too much...","nextNodeIds":[760310315]},{"nodeId":760310315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"Lauma","textMapHash":733798978,"text":"Ah, I see... Understood. I'll handle it.","nextNodeIds":[760310316]},{"nodeId":760310316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":234709242,"text":"To be honest, after seeing how busy you are, Paimon kinda feels bad asking you to do more work...","nextNodeIds":[760310317]},{"nodeId":760310317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"Lauma","textMapHash":385768322,"text":"Ah, it's nothing. Such is the duty of the Moonchanter.","nextNodeIds":[760310318]},{"nodeId":760310318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"Lauma","textMapHash":3583911650,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[760310319]},{"nodeId":760310319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":4083504874,"text":"...Hm?","nextNodeIds":[760310320]},{"nodeId":760310320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"Lauma","textMapHash":1258578298,"text":"...Now that you have seen all this, \"Kuu{RUBY#[S]Moon Maiden}tar\", what do you think of the Frostmoon Scions today?","nextNodeIds":[760310321]},{"nodeId":760310321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1619333994,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[760310322]},{"nodeId":760310322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3860637058,"text":"The atmosphere is much changed from how it was several centuries ago. It's a good kind of change.","nextNodeIds":[760310323]},{"nodeId":760310323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"Lauma","textMapHash":402819034,"text":"I'm glad to hear it... And I thank you for your kind words.","nextNodeIds":[760310324]},{"nodeId":760310324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3468153386,"text":"Give me your hand.","nextNodeIds":[760310325]},{"nodeId":760310325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3083970234,"text":"#You too, {NICKNAME}.","nextNodeIds":[760310326]},{"nodeId":760310326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"Lauma","textMapHash":4073650258,"text":"...Oh, um... Why?","nextNodeIds":[760310327]},{"nodeId":760310327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":3090289386,"text":"I like the current prayer you use around here.","nextNodeIds":[760310328]},{"nodeId":760310328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"The Damselette","textMapHash":1172361842,"text":"...Come night or day, may the moonlight connect us.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7603103,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":[],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_ACTIVE_DAMSELETTE_FREE_MOON_PHASE"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1315"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7603104,"order":5,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":1593703292,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7603104,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_11929:1721.614,224.484,10429.120]"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[